1
00:00:02,258 --> 00:00:04,427
KATARA: Water.

2
00:00:04,844 --> 00:00:06,304
Earth.

3
00:00:06,596 --> 00:00:08,598
Fire.

4
00:00:08,890 --> 00:00:10,308
Air.

5
00:00:11,142 --> 00:00:15,104
Long ago, the four nations
lived together in harmony.

6
00:00:15,438 --> 00:00:19,275
Then, everything changed
when the Fire Nation attacked.

7
00:00:19,776 --> 00:00:22,403
Only the Avatar,
master of all four elements,

8
00:00:22,529 --> 00:00:23,738
could stop them.

9
00:00:23,863 --> 00:00:26,699
But when the world
needed him most, he vanished.

10
00:00:27,367 --> 00:00:29,494
A hundred years passed,
and my brother and I discovered

11
00:00:29,577 --> 00:00:32,664
the new Avatar, an airbender named Aang.

12
00:00:32,956 --> 00:00:35,166
And although
his airbending skills are great,

13
00:00:35,291 --> 00:00:37,585
he has a lot to learn before
he's ready to save anyone.

14
00:00:37,710 --> 00:00:38,920
AANG: Oof!

15
00:00:39,045 --> 00:00:42,006
But I believe Aang can save the world.

16
00:00:58,136 --> 00:01:00,681
Hey, I remember her.
She helped you attack us.

17
00:01:01,390 --> 00:01:03,392
Yep. Back in the good old days.

18
00:01:04,810 --> 00:01:06,937
JUNE: Oh, great, it's Prince Pouty.

19
00:01:07,062 --> 00:01:08,271
Where's your creepy grandpa?

20
00:01:08,522 --> 00:01:11,191
He's my uncle. And he's not here.

21
00:01:12,109 --> 00:01:14,194
I see you worked things
out with your girlfriend.

22
00:01:14,361 --> 00:01:16,363
- I'm not his girlfriend!
- She's not my girlfriend!

23
00:01:16,738 --> 00:01:20,742
Okay, okay, sheesh. I was only teasing.

24
00:01:20,867 --> 00:01:22,119
So what do you want?

25
00:01:22,244 --> 00:01:24,121
I need your help finding the Avatar.

26
00:01:24,246 --> 00:01:26,581
Hmm, doesn't sound too fun.

27
00:01:28,166 --> 00:01:31,044
Does the end of the world
sound like more fun?

28
00:01:31,253 --> 00:01:33,171
( BOTH GROWLING )

29
00:01:33,296 --> 00:01:35,132
( SLURPING )

30
00:01:37,718 --> 00:01:39,261
Nyla?

31
00:01:39,886 --> 00:01:41,638
( CHOMPING )

32
00:01:41,763 --> 00:01:45,100
Whose my little snuffly-wuffly?

33
00:01:45,225 --> 00:01:47,269
Whoa! Careful there!

34
00:01:47,394 --> 00:01:50,272
Okay, so who's got something
with the Avatar's scent on it?

35
00:01:50,439 --> 00:01:51,898
I have Aang's staff.

36
00:01:53,859 --> 00:01:56,278
( SNIFFING )

37
00:01:59,698 --> 00:02:03,035
( SNIFFING )

38
00:02:06,163 --> 00:02:08,498
( SNIFFING )

39
00:02:09,708 --> 00:02:12,127
( QUIET GROWLING )

40
00:02:12,252 --> 00:02:14,004
Well, what does that mean?

41
00:02:14,337 --> 00:02:15,839
It means your friend's gone.

42
00:02:16,214 --> 00:02:17,674
We know he's gone.

43
00:02:17,799 --> 00:02:19,509
That's why we're trying to find him.

44
00:02:19,801 --> 00:02:21,428
No, I mean he's gone-gone.

45
00:02:21,553 --> 00:02:23,055
He doesn't exist.

46
00:02:27,768 --> 00:02:29,144
( CHATTERING )

47
00:02:29,269 --> 00:02:30,604
Where are we, Momo?

48
00:02:33,106 --> 00:02:35,150
Maybe I'm in the Spirit World?

49
00:02:37,861 --> 00:02:40,197
But, wait, you can see me.

50
00:02:40,322 --> 00:02:42,365
We could both be in the Spirit World.

51
00:02:46,787 --> 00:02:49,081
Nope, my bending works.

52
00:02:49,206 --> 00:02:51,333
Maybe if we climb to
the top of the island,

53
00:02:51,458 --> 00:02:53,085
we can figure out where we are.

54
00:02:54,669 --> 00:02:56,880
What do you mean Aang doesn't exist?

55
00:03:00,133 --> 00:03:02,511
Nope, we could find him if he were dead.

56
00:03:02,636 --> 00:03:04,346
Oh, it's a real head-scratcher.

57
00:03:04,429 --> 00:03:05,555
See ya.

58
00:03:06,098 --> 00:03:08,475
TOPH: Helpful. Real helpful.

59
00:03:08,600 --> 00:03:10,477
ZUKO: Wait, I have another idea.

60
00:03:11,103 --> 00:03:12,813
There's only one other person
in this world

61
00:03:12,938 --> 00:03:14,981
who can help us face the Fire Lord.

62
00:03:15,107 --> 00:03:17,067
I'll be right back with a smell sample.

63
00:03:17,776 --> 00:03:19,152
( FLIES BUZZING )

64
00:03:19,277 --> 00:03:21,780
You saved your uncle's sweaty sandal?

65
00:03:21,905 --> 00:03:23,698
I think it's kind of sweet.

66
00:03:24,783 --> 00:03:27,035
( SNIFFING )

67
00:03:27,160 --> 00:03:28,411
Let's do this.

68
00:03:31,373 --> 00:03:32,833
ZUKO: Hey, wait up!

69
00:03:57,816 --> 00:03:59,401
ZUKO: We're going to Ba Sing Se?

70
00:04:00,652 --> 00:04:02,487
JUNE: Your uncle is
somewhere beyond the wall.

71
00:04:02,612 --> 00:04:04,656
Nyla is getting twitchy,
so he can't be too far.

72
00:04:05,073 --> 00:04:06,658
Good luck.

73
00:04:10,745 --> 00:04:12,080
It's been a long day.

74
00:04:12,247 --> 00:04:14,207
Let's camp and start
our search again at dawn.

75
00:04:17,836 --> 00:04:22,507
( BIRDS TWITTERING )

76
00:04:22,632 --> 00:04:24,759
It's a hexagon.

77
00:04:24,885 --> 00:04:26,428
( CHATTERS )

78
00:04:26,553 --> 00:04:28,430
It doesn't seem like normal rock.

79
00:04:32,934 --> 00:04:34,603
It's not made of earth.

80
00:04:34,728 --> 00:04:36,521
This is so strange.

81
00:04:36,771 --> 00:04:41,026
I wish some help right now.
I wish I had Roku.

82
00:04:41,151 --> 00:04:43,195
I do have Roku!

83
00:04:43,320 --> 00:04:46,781
( BREATHING DEEPLY )

84
00:04:54,039 --> 00:04:55,790
You're right, Aang.

85
00:04:55,916 --> 00:04:58,543
All the past Avatars,

86
00:04:58,668 --> 00:05:03,048
all their experience and wisdom
is available to you,

87
00:05:03,340 --> 00:05:06,885
if you look deep inside yourself.

88
00:05:07,010 --> 00:05:10,180
So, where am I, Roku? What is this place?

89
00:05:10,305 --> 00:05:13,683
I don't know, Aang.

90
00:05:13,934 --> 00:05:17,812
But I see that you are lost in
more ways than one right now.

91
00:05:18,021 --> 00:05:19,064
I am.

92
00:05:19,189 --> 00:05:22,067
I need to figure out what to do
once I face the Fire Lord.

93
00:05:23,944 --> 00:05:25,946
SOKKA: ( SNORING )

94
00:05:26,571 --> 00:05:27,614
Huh?

95
00:05:32,452 --> 00:05:33,703
APPA: ( BELLOWING )

96
00:05:41,503 --> 00:05:43,505
Well, look who's here.

97
00:05:43,630 --> 00:05:45,340
( LAUGHS, SNORTS )

98
00:05:55,850 --> 00:05:58,019
Everyone expects me to
take the Fire Lord's life.

99
00:05:58,270 --> 00:06:00,355
But I just don't know if I can do that.

100
00:06:00,480 --> 00:06:05,902
In my life, I tried to be
disciplined and show restraint,

101
00:06:06,027 --> 00:06:08,613
but it backfired when Fire Lord Sozin

102
00:06:08,738 --> 00:06:12,701
took advantage of my restraint and mercy.

103
00:06:12,826 --> 00:06:16,830
If had been more decisive,
and acted sooner,

104
00:06:16,955 --> 00:06:18,790
I could have stopped Sozin

105
00:06:18,915 --> 00:06:22,377
and stopped the war before it started.

106
00:06:22,544 --> 00:06:25,297
I offer you this wisdom, Aang.

107
00:06:25,463 --> 00:06:28,008
You must be decisive.

108
00:06:34,848 --> 00:06:36,099
TOPH: What's going on?

109
00:06:36,308 --> 00:06:38,143
We're surrounded by old people.

110
00:06:38,310 --> 00:06:39,811
KATARA: Not just any old people,

111
00:06:40,061 --> 00:06:42,814
these are great masters
and friends of ours.

112
00:06:42,939 --> 00:06:44,190
Pakku.

113
00:06:44,274 --> 00:06:47,027
It is respectful to bow to an old master.

114
00:06:47,485 --> 00:06:50,905
But how about a hug
for your new grandfather?

115
00:06:51,781 --> 00:06:53,491
- That's so exciting!
- SOKKA: ( GASPS )

116
00:06:53,616 --> 00:06:55,201
You and Gran-Gran must be so happy

117
00:06:55,327 --> 00:06:57,203
to have found each other again.

118
00:06:57,329 --> 00:07:00,623
I made her a new betrothal
necklace and everything.

119
00:07:00,749 --> 00:07:02,834
Welcome to the family, Gramp-Gramp!

120
00:07:02,959 --> 00:07:05,462
You can still just call me Pakku.

121
00:07:05,879 --> 00:07:08,965
How about Gramp-Pakku?

122
00:07:09,382 --> 00:07:10,800
No.

123
00:07:10,925 --> 00:07:13,887
And this was Aang's
first firebending teacher.

124
00:07:14,012 --> 00:07:15,889
Jeong Jeong.

125
00:07:16,348 --> 00:07:17,807
Master Piandao.

126
00:07:17,932 --> 00:07:19,225
Hello, Sokka.

127
00:07:19,809 --> 00:07:22,145
So, wait, how do you all know each other?

128
00:07:22,270 --> 00:07:25,440
All old people know each other,
don't you know that?

129
00:07:25,565 --> 00:07:27,525
( LAUGHS, SNORTS )

130
00:07:27,650 --> 00:07:30,612
We're all are part of the same
ancient secret society,

131
00:07:30,737 --> 00:07:34,491
a group that transcends the
divisions of the four nations.

132
00:07:34,616 --> 00:07:36,409
The Order of the White Lotus.

133
00:07:36,826 --> 00:07:38,828
That's the one.

134
00:07:38,953 --> 00:07:41,664
The White Lotus has always
been about philosophy,

135
00:07:41,790 --> 00:07:43,291
and beauty, and truth.

136
00:07:44,000 --> 00:07:45,877
But about a month ago, a call went out

137
00:07:46,002 --> 00:07:48,129
that we were needed
for something important.

138
00:07:48,630 --> 00:07:51,549
It came from a Grand Lotus, your uncle,

139
00:07:51,841 --> 00:07:53,760
Iroh of the Fire Nation.

140
00:07:53,885 --> 00:07:55,345
Well, that's who we're looking for.

141
00:07:55,678 --> 00:07:57,389
Then we'll take you to him.

142
00:07:57,514 --> 00:08:00,350
Wait, someone's missing from your group,

143
00:08:00,475 --> 00:08:03,269
someone very important.

144
00:08:03,395 --> 00:08:05,563
Where's Momo?

145
00:08:05,688 --> 00:08:09,234
He's gone... And so is Aang.

146
00:08:09,359 --> 00:08:11,236
Oh, well, so long as they have each other,

147
00:08:11,361 --> 00:08:13,488
I'm sure we have nothing to worry about.

148
00:08:13,571 --> 00:08:14,614
Let's go!

149
00:08:14,697 --> 00:08:17,409
( SNORTING LAUGHTER )

150
00:08:20,161 --> 00:08:22,372
( CHATTERS )

151
00:08:22,497 --> 00:08:26,584
Avatar Kyoshi, I need your wisdom.

152
00:08:34,676 --> 00:08:37,137
In my day, Chin The Conqueror

153
00:08:37,262 --> 00:08:39,264
threatened to throw
the world out of balance.

154
00:08:41,474 --> 00:08:46,271
I stopped him and the world
entered a great era of peace.

155
00:08:46,729 --> 00:08:47,939
AANG: But you didn't really kill Chin.

156
00:08:48,064 --> 00:08:49,482
Technically, he fell to his own doom

157
00:08:49,607 --> 00:08:51,818
because he was too stubborn
to get out of the way.

158
00:08:51,943 --> 00:08:54,487
Personally,
I don't really see the difference.

159
00:08:54,612 --> 00:08:56,239
But I assure you,

160
00:08:56,364 --> 00:08:59,284
I would have done whatever
it took to stop Chin.

161
00:08:59,701 --> 00:09:02,120
I offer you this wisdom, Aang.

162
00:09:02,245 --> 00:09:04,581
Only justice will bring peace.

163
00:09:07,750 --> 00:09:09,878
I knew I shouldn't have asked Kyoshi...

164
00:09:12,630 --> 00:09:14,257
SOKKA: So, Bumi,
how did you end up escaping

165
00:09:14,382 --> 00:09:16,259
your imprisonment in Omashu?

166
00:09:16,384 --> 00:09:18,720
Escape? I didn't escape.

167
00:09:18,845 --> 00:09:20,847
Everybody else escaped.

168
00:09:21,389 --> 00:09:23,349
There I was, back in Omashu,

169
00:09:23,475 --> 00:09:26,436
waiting for just the right moment.

170
00:09:26,561 --> 00:09:28,062
I didn't know what or when,

171
00:09:28,188 --> 00:09:31,691
but I knew I'd know it when I knew it.

172
00:09:31,816 --> 00:09:33,776
An eclipse! That'll do it!

173
00:09:34,694 --> 00:09:36,571
( STRAINING )

174
00:09:44,954 --> 00:09:46,539
What do you think you're doing?

175
00:09:46,664 --> 00:09:48,166
( GRUNTS )

176
00:09:48,291 --> 00:09:49,959
( GRUNTS )

177
00:09:51,377 --> 00:09:53,213
Taking back my city.

178
00:09:53,338 --> 00:09:56,508
You've got no firepower,
and it's payback time!

179
00:10:13,316 --> 00:10:15,527
( RUMBLING )

180
00:10:31,251 --> 00:10:32,710
( STRAINING )

181
00:10:41,928 --> 00:10:43,429
( LAUGHS, SNORTS )

182
00:10:43,555 --> 00:10:45,348
( CHOMPING )

183
00:10:46,224 --> 00:10:49,894
Wow, you took back your whole
city all by yourself.

184
00:10:50,395 --> 00:10:52,355
BUMI: So, what about you guys?

185
00:10:52,480 --> 00:10:55,191
Did you do anything interesting
on the day of the eclipse?

186
00:10:56,609 --> 00:10:58,444
- Nah.
- No, not really.

187
00:10:59,529 --> 00:11:01,656
I need to look deep inside myself.

188
00:11:11,291 --> 00:11:13,626
I am Avatar Kuruk.

189
00:11:13,751 --> 00:11:15,295
When I was young,

190
00:11:15,420 --> 00:11:20,633
I was always a "go with the flow"
kind of Avatar.

191
00:11:20,758 --> 00:11:23,011
People seemed to work
out their own problems,

192
00:11:23,136 --> 00:11:26,264
and there was peace
and good times in the world.

193
00:11:28,349 --> 00:11:30,935
But then, I lost the woman I loved

194
00:11:31,060 --> 00:11:35,732
to Koh, the face stealer.

195
00:11:35,857 --> 00:11:37,442
It was my fault.

196
00:11:37,567 --> 00:11:40,111
If I had been more attentive
and more active,

197
00:11:40,236 --> 00:11:42,488
I could have saved her.

198
00:11:42,614 --> 00:11:46,826
Aang, you must actively
shape your own destiny,

199
00:11:46,951 --> 00:11:49,037
and the destiny of the world.

200
00:12:01,341 --> 00:12:04,761
Well, here we are.
Welcome to old people camp.

201
00:12:06,888 --> 00:12:09,349
Where? Where is he?

202
00:12:09,474 --> 00:12:11,643
Your uncle's in there, Prince Zuko.

203
00:12:22,945 --> 00:12:24,072
Are you okay?

204
00:12:24,197 --> 00:12:26,115
No, I'm not okay.

205
00:12:26,240 --> 00:12:28,034
My uncle hates me, I know it.

206
00:12:28,159 --> 00:12:31,120
He loved me and supported me
in every way he could,

207
00:12:31,245 --> 00:12:33,289
and I still turned against him.

208
00:12:33,414 --> 00:12:34,999
How can I even face him?

209
00:12:35,124 --> 00:12:38,252
Zuko, you're sorry
for what you did, right?

210
00:12:38,378 --> 00:12:39,629
More sorry than I've been about anything

211
00:12:39,754 --> 00:12:41,339
in my entire life.

212
00:12:41,464 --> 00:12:44,008
Then he'll forgive you. He will.

213
00:12:49,263 --> 00:12:52,684
( EXHALES )

214
00:12:53,101 --> 00:12:54,352
Uncle...

215
00:12:54,477 --> 00:12:58,398
( SNORING )

216
00:13:09,826 --> 00:13:11,411
AANG: All these past Avatars,

217
00:13:11,494 --> 00:13:13,871
they keep telling me
I'm gonna have to do it.

218
00:13:13,996 --> 00:13:15,957
- They don't get it.
-( CHATTERS )

219
00:13:16,082 --> 00:13:18,126
You're right, maybe an Air Nomad Avatar

220
00:13:18,251 --> 00:13:20,253
will understand where I'm coming from.

221
00:13:20,378 --> 00:13:22,130
( PURRS )

222
00:13:22,213 --> 00:13:23,631
I know you can't really talk.

223
00:13:24,090 --> 00:13:26,008
Pretending you can just helps me think.

224
00:13:26,134 --> 00:13:27,635
( CHATTERS )

225
00:13:27,760 --> 00:13:30,096
I'm going to pretend
I didn't pretend to hear that.

226
00:13:38,730 --> 00:13:41,607
I am Avatar Yangchen, young airbender.

227
00:13:42,024 --> 00:13:44,360
Avatar Yangchen,
the monks always taught me

228
00:13:44,485 --> 00:13:46,070
that all life is sacred,

229
00:13:46,195 --> 00:13:48,906
even the life of the tiniest spider-fly
caught in its own web.

230
00:13:49,741 --> 00:13:52,285
Yes, all life is sacred.

231
00:13:52,702 --> 00:13:54,787
I know. I'm even a vegetarian.

232
00:13:54,912 --> 00:13:56,581
I've always tried to solve my problems

233
00:13:56,706 --> 00:13:58,124
by being quick or clever,

234
00:13:58,249 --> 00:14:00,960
and I've only had to use
violence for necessary defense,

235
00:14:01,085 --> 00:14:03,671
and I've certainly never
used it to take a life.

236
00:14:03,796 --> 00:14:07,717
Avatar Aang, I know that
you're a gentle spirit,

237
00:14:07,842 --> 00:14:10,178
and the monks have taught you well,

238
00:14:10,303 --> 00:14:12,430
but this isn't about you.

239
00:14:12,555 --> 00:14:14,348
This is about the world.

240
00:14:14,474 --> 00:14:16,809
But the monks taught me,
that I have to detach myself

241
00:14:16,934 --> 00:14:19,187
from the world so my spirit could be free.

242
00:14:19,437 --> 00:14:23,107
Many great and wise Air Nomads
have detached themselves

243
00:14:23,232 --> 00:14:25,985
and achieved spiritual enlightenment.

244
00:14:26,110 --> 00:14:28,279
But the Avatar can never do it,

245
00:14:28,404 --> 00:14:31,908
because your sole duty is to the world.

246
00:14:32,033 --> 00:14:34,702
Here is my wisdom for you...

247
00:14:35,203 --> 00:14:37,580
Selfless duty calls you to sacrifice

248
00:14:37,705 --> 00:14:39,957
your own spiritual needs

249
00:14:40,082 --> 00:14:44,253
and do whatever it takes
to protect the world.

250
00:14:46,714 --> 00:14:49,342
( CHATTERING )

251
00:14:49,467 --> 00:14:51,302
I guess I don't have a choice, Momo.

252
00:14:51,427 --> 00:14:53,971
I have to kill the Fire Lord.

253
00:15:05,399 --> 00:15:07,360
( YAWNING )

254
00:15:12,031 --> 00:15:17,787
Uncle, I know you must have
mixed feelings about seeing me.

255
00:15:17,912 --> 00:15:22,667
But I want you to know
I am so, so sorry, Uncle.

256
00:15:23,292 --> 00:15:26,337
I am so sorry and ashamed of what I did.

257
00:15:26,462 --> 00:15:29,423
I don't know how I can ever
make it up to you, but I―

258
00:15:35,555 --> 00:15:37,765
How can you forgive me so easily?

259
00:15:37,890 --> 00:15:39,642
I thought you would be furious with me.

260
00:15:39,767 --> 00:15:43,229
I was never angry with you.

261
00:15:43,354 --> 00:15:47,942
I was sad, because I was
afraid you'd lost your way.

262
00:15:48,067 --> 00:15:50,820
I did lose my way.

263
00:15:50,945 --> 00:15:54,490
But you've found it again...

264
00:15:55,283 --> 00:15:58,077
And you did it by yourself,

265
00:15:58,202 --> 00:16:02,290
and I am so happy you found your way here.

266
00:16:03,207 --> 00:16:05,585
It wasn't that hard, Uncle.

267
00:16:05,710 --> 00:16:07,795
You have a pretty strong scent.

268
00:16:09,088 --> 00:16:10,548
( SQUEAKS )

269
00:16:11,007 --> 00:16:12,717
( BIRDS CALLING )

270
00:16:14,719 --> 00:16:16,095
( DISTANT RUMBLING )

271
00:16:16,220 --> 00:16:18,389
( YAWNS )

272
00:16:18,514 --> 00:16:20,266
( RUMBLING CONTINUES )

273
00:16:20,349 --> 00:16:24,437
Wait, is it just me or are
those mountains getting bigger?

274
00:16:24,687 --> 00:16:26,355
( CHATTERS )

275
00:16:35,323 --> 00:16:37,283
They're not getting larger,
they're getting closer.

276
00:16:37,408 --> 00:16:38,826
( CHATTERS )

277
00:16:40,953 --> 00:16:42,496
The whole island is moving!

278
00:16:49,086 --> 00:16:50,504
( CHATTERS )

279
00:17:05,561 --> 00:17:07,396
( GASPS )

280
00:17:07,521 --> 00:17:08,689
( CHATTERING )

281
00:17:08,814 --> 00:17:10,316
It's amazing, Momo!

282
00:17:10,441 --> 00:17:12,193
The biggest animal in the world!

283
00:17:12,318 --> 00:17:14,612
I've gotta swim around and find its face.

284
00:17:26,207 --> 00:17:29,210
ZUKO: Uncle, you're the only
person other than the Avatar

285
00:17:29,335 --> 00:17:31,963
who can possibly defeat the Father Lord.

286
00:17:32,088 --> 00:17:33,631
You mean the Fire Lord?

287
00:17:33,756 --> 00:17:35,216
That's what I just said.

288
00:17:35,341 --> 00:17:37,218
Hmm...

289
00:17:37,343 --> 00:17:38,970
We need you to come with us.

290
00:17:39,595 --> 00:17:41,055
No, Zuko.

291
00:17:41,180 --> 00:17:42,723
It won't turn out well.

292
00:17:43,099 --> 00:17:45,977
You can beat him
and we'll be there to help.

293
00:17:46,102 --> 00:17:48,521
Even if I did defeat Ozai,

294
00:17:48,646 --> 00:17:51,107
and I don't know that I could,

295
00:17:51,232 --> 00:17:53,943
it would be the wrong way to end a war.

296
00:17:54,402 --> 00:17:57,905
History would see it as just
more senseless violence,

297
00:17:58,030 --> 00:18:01,117
a brother killing a brother to grab power.

298
00:18:01,242 --> 00:18:03,911
The only way
for this war to end peacefully

299
00:18:04,036 --> 00:18:07,707
is for the Avatar to defeat the Fire Lord.

300
00:18:08,541 --> 00:18:10,793
And then... Then would you come and take

301
00:18:10,918 --> 00:18:12,503
your rightful place on the throne?

302
00:18:13,045 --> 00:18:16,966
No. Someone new must take the throne...

303
00:18:17,091 --> 00:18:22,555
An idealist with a pure heart
and unquestionable honor.

304
00:18:22,680 --> 00:18:25,558
It has to be you, Prince Zuko.

305
00:18:25,683 --> 00:18:27,643
Unquestionable honor?

306
00:18:27,768 --> 00:18:29,478
But I've made so many mistakes.

307
00:18:29,603 --> 00:18:31,981
Yes, you have.

308
00:18:32,106 --> 00:18:35,109
You've struggled and you've suffered,

309
00:18:35,234 --> 00:18:37,987
but you have always
followed your own path.

310
00:18:38,195 --> 00:18:40,656
You restored your own honor,

311
00:18:40,781 --> 00:18:45,661
and only you can restore
the honor of the Fire Nation.

312
00:18:45,786 --> 00:18:47,705
I'll try, Uncle.

313
00:18:48,122 --> 00:18:50,624
Well, what if Aang doesn't come back?

314
00:18:51,375 --> 00:18:55,421
Sozin's Comet is arriving
and our destinies are upon us.

315
00:18:55,546 --> 00:18:57,590
Aang will face the Fire Lord.

316
00:18:58,799 --> 00:19:01,343
When I was a boy, I had a vision

317
00:19:01,469 --> 00:19:04,388
that I would one day take Ba Sing Se.

318
00:19:04,847 --> 00:19:07,224
Only now do I see that my destiny

319
00:19:07,349 --> 00:19:10,519
is to take it back from the Fire Nation,

320
00:19:10,644 --> 00:19:14,190
so the Earth Kingdom can be free again.

321
00:19:15,024 --> 00:19:17,943
That's why you gathered
the members of the White Lotus.

322
00:19:18,069 --> 00:19:20,029
Yes.

323
00:19:20,154 --> 00:19:23,449
Zuko, you must return to the Fire Nation,

324
00:19:23,574 --> 00:19:25,534
so that when the Fire Lord falls,

325
00:19:25,659 --> 00:19:30,539
you can assume the throne
and restore peace and order.

326
00:19:30,664 --> 00:19:33,959
But Azula will be there waiting for you.

327
00:19:34,085 --> 00:19:35,836
I can handle Azula.

328
00:19:35,961 --> 00:19:39,340
Not alone. You'll need help.

329
00:19:39,465 --> 00:19:40,841
You're right.

330
00:19:40,925 --> 00:19:44,011
Katara, how would you like to
help me put Azula in her place?

331
00:19:44,428 --> 00:19:46,347
It would be my pleasure.

332
00:19:46,472 --> 00:19:48,974
What about us? What's our destiny today?

333
00:19:49,725 --> 00:19:51,977
What do you think it is?

334
00:19:52,103 --> 00:19:54,855
I think that even though
we don't know where Aang is,

335
00:19:54,980 --> 00:19:57,900
we need to do everything we can
to stop the airship fleet.

336
00:19:58,025 --> 00:20:00,486
And that means, when Aang
does face the Fire Lord,

337
00:20:00,611 --> 00:20:02,863
we'll be right there if he need us.

338
00:20:08,661 --> 00:20:10,204
Nothing runs faster over land

339
00:20:10,329 --> 00:20:12,957
or swims quicker than a giant eel-hound.

340
00:20:13,332 --> 00:20:15,167
The airship base is on a small island

341
00:20:15,292 --> 00:20:17,294
just off the Earth Kingdom shore.

342
00:20:17,503 --> 00:20:21,465
You should be able to intercept the fleet
within a day's journey.

343
00:20:21,590 --> 00:20:23,050
Thank you, master.

344
00:20:29,265 --> 00:20:32,643
So, if I'm gonna be Fire Lord
after the war's over,

345
00:20:32,726 --> 00:20:34,061
what are you gonna do?

346
00:20:34,186 --> 00:20:37,273
After I reconquer Ba Sing Se,

347
00:20:37,398 --> 00:20:40,067
I am going to reconquer my tea shop

348
00:20:40,192 --> 00:20:43,696
and I am going to play Pai Sho every day.

349
00:20:48,367 --> 00:20:51,954
- Goodbye, General Iroh.
- Goodbye, everyone.

350
00:20:52,079 --> 00:20:57,001
Today, destiny is our friend. I know it.

351
00:21:38,751 --> 00:21:40,753
A Lion Turtle.

352
00:21:43,923 --> 00:21:45,466
Maybe you can help me.

353
00:21:45,591 --> 00:21:48,969
Everyone, even my own past lives

354
00:21:49,094 --> 00:21:52,932
are expecting me to end someone's life.

355
00:21:53,057 --> 00:21:54,600
But I don't know if I can do it.

356
00:21:54,808 --> 00:21:57,770
LION TURTLE: The true mind
can weather all the lies

357
00:21:57,895 --> 00:22:01,315
and illusions without being lost.

358
00:22:01,565 --> 00:22:04,568
The true heart can tough
the poison of hatred

359
00:22:04,693 --> 00:22:07,112
without being harmed.

360
00:22:07,321 --> 00:22:11,492
Since beginningless time,
darkness thrives in the void,

361
00:22:11,617 --> 00:22:15,246
but always yields to purifying light.

362
00:22:25,965 --> 00:22:27,383
Wait for him.

363
00:22:27,508 --> 00:22:29,260
He will come.

364
00:22:40,479 --> 00:22:44,233
It's time for this world to end in fire

365
00:22:44,358 --> 00:22:48,612
and for a new world
to be born from the ashes.

366
00:23:21,006 --> 00:23:23,008
( CLOSING THEME PLAYING )
